Description: fate/hevc: test the probe of a raw stream with an alpha layer
 .
 Probe a raw HEVC stream made by x265 --alpha, whose alpha layer has
 nuh_layer_id 1, without naming the format.
 .
 The sample is an x265 stream of 8 frames of 64x64 pixels.
 .
 Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
 .
 Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
